				<r3d:remarks>is covered by Elsevier.
TAIR collaborates with the Arabidopsis Biological Resource Center (ABRC). The Arabidopsis Biological Resource Center at The Ohio State University collects, reproduces, preserves and distributes seed and DNA resources of Arabidopsis thaliana and related species. Stock information and ordering for the ABRC are fully integrated into TAIR. The ABRC&#039;s mission is to aquire, preserve and distribute seed and DNA resources that are useful to the Arabidopsis research community.</r3d:remarks>
